    "body": "**Describe the bug**\r\nDT_TOOLCHAIN_DIR cannot be used to evaluate LIBRARY_SEARCH_PATHS, use TOOLCHAIN_DIR instead\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\n- CocoaPods version 1.12.0\r\n- Firebase SDK Version 10.0\r\n\r\n**Resolved Methods**\r\nbundle update cocoapods\r\nUsing cocoapods 1.15.2 (was 1.12.1)\r\n\r\n**Other **\r\n- https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk/issues/11608\r\n- https://github.com/CocoaPods/CocoaPods/pull/12009\r\n- https://guides.cocoapods.org/using/unreleased-features\r\n- https://bundler.io/guides/updating_gems.html\r\n",
